==Battleground==
*1 [[Inumusha]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[M. Ost]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Largely similar to the original, the stage's omission of [[Zang Roo]]s, [[UltraBaaBaa]]s and [[Corporal Weyland]]s all ease its difficulty, which in turn are shifted onto the Relic threats. Inumusha remains the least of all concerns, leaving M. Ost and Othom as the prime threats, since both have dangerous abilities that cripple the Anti-Zombie specialists. Victory awaits if they are promptly dealt with.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] - Has enough range to stay somewhat safe from being Cursed, except from Othom, who has a measly 2 second Curse, and can deal huge damage with Savage Blows. Plus, she can potentially slow any Zombies, and will kill them off permanently.
*[[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] - A useful Crowd-Controller for the Dread Bores when [[Talents|Talented]], provided you can keep him safe from being Cursed.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] - Can clear peons and knockback Inumusha from afar, helping greatly to relieve some pressure on your frontline.
*[[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Paragon Cat]] - Knocks back any Zombies that burrow too close to your base. Especially useful for the first Dread Bore, since they are likely to burrow right up to your base and spawn too soon to be stopped with Holy Blast. Plus, unlike [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Recruit]], he won't move forward, meaning he won't push as hard into Inumusha's attack range.
*[[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] - With his Insane Damage towards Zombies, he can nuke down the first Dread Bore before Othom reaches the frontlines, making dealing with it much easier.
*[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] - With a fast attack cycle, Resistance to Zombies and Zombie Killer, the slow Shigong can actually see some use here at the beginning, as he can tank a number of hits from even Inumusha and keep the Dread Bores pinned for Cadaver BearCat to easily nuked. Combined with other DPS units and a Holy Blast, Shigong can possibly eliminate Inumunsha completely even before M. Ost could spawn.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Section Chief Gravicci]] - In True Form, the unit's Curse Immunity and Target Relic Talents can steamroll the stage, as all enemies are within his targeted traits. His attacks freeze them for 5 seconds while generating level 3 Wave Attacks that extend his reach, shutting down the pushers for a large window of opportunity.
*[[Queen Reika (Uber Rare Cat)|Eternal Reika]] - Has anti-Relic Talents just like Gravicci, however she's more focused on dealing raw damage. She also fully outranges Othom's Omni Strikes.
*[[Mighty Kat-A-Pult (Uber Rare Cat)|CAT-10 Gigapult]] - With incredibly high health and a permanent Weaken against both major traits in this stage, it will make stalling the enemies easier and can even help defeat them with its rather high damage. Keep in mind, Gigapult is not immune to knockback, so it is recommended to bring something to counter M. Ost and Trolly Bloggers specifically. Besides that, this stage becomes relatively free since Gigapult can soak up the damage from every single enemy here and come out unscathed.
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]] - Incredible damage, health and freeze time on BOTH Zombies and Relics all but completely nullifies every single threat in this stage. Pair her with some strong attackers and the stage is free.

